  recall: ['A census counts every person of a country.', 'Asia has about 60 % of the world population.', 'Cameroon has an area of about 475,650 km².'],
  situation: 'The Littoral Region has about 190 people per km² while the East Region has only about 11 people per km². A company wants to open a supermarket and a new bus line and hesitates between Douala and Bertoua. The manager asks: "How are people spread across Cameroon and the world, and how can we measure how crowded an area is?"',
